            <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-[#003060] rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-white shrink-0 shadow-sm">
              <img src="/public/image/about/values/curiosity.svg" alt="Curiosity" class="w-6 h-6 object-contain" />
            </div>
            <h3 class="font-montserrat font-bold text-[20px] leading-none text-[#0B1F3B]">
              Curiosity
            </h3>
          </div>
          <p class="font-sans font-normal text-[14px] leading-[24px] text-[#000000CC]">
            We position curiosity as the main key to innovation. We motivate unlimited exploration, continuous critical questioning, and the discovery of new frontiers.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Card 5: Resilience -->
        <div class="bg-[#E0F1F9]/65 backdrop-blur-[6.6px] border border-[#E0F1F9] rounded-[20px] p-6 shadow-[0px_4px_12px_0px_#00000010]">
